OL,3,ATwo dead after bus crashes in France,
OL,4,Aofficials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young girl and an 18-year-old man
OL,7,Fhave died after a bus crashed in
OL,8,Feastern France, local authorities have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe bus was travelling between Lyon and
OL,12,FBourg-en-Bresse when it crashed at
OL,13,Faround 07:00 local time on Friday in
OL,14,Fthe town of Lent, about 34 miles (55km)
OL,15,Ffrom the border with Switzerland.
OL,17,FThe bus was carrying 43 passengers,
OL,18,Fincluding 15 children, the
OL,19,FBourg-en-Bresse prosecutor's office
OL,20,Fsaid. Three people are in a critical
OL,21,Fcondition and at least 13 others have
OL,22,Fsustained minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
